OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Haaland and Mbappe to
OL,4,AStrictly, Nellis 'never imagined'
OL,5,Ajoining hit show
OL,6,
OL,7,FA social media star more accustomed to
OL,8,Fcreating content with some of the
OL,9,Fbiggest names in world football, says
OL,10,Fhe "never imagined" his career would
OL,11,Flead him to a spot on Strictly Come
OL,12,FDancing.
OL,14,FJohn Nellis, who boasts over 16 million
OL,15,Fsubscribers on YouTube, has interviewed
OL,16,FReal Madrid's Kylian Mbappe, Manchester
OL,17,FCity's Erling Haaland and England
OL,18,Fcaptain Harry Kane to name a few.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
