OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Haaland and Mbappe to
OL,4,AStrictly, Nellis 'never imagined'
OL,5,Ajoining hit show
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut after stepping out of his comfort
OL,8,Fzone and onto the dance floor, he has
OL,9,Fimpressed the Strictly judges alongside
OL,10,Fhis dance partner Katya Jones.
OL,12,FNellis said the pressure of dancing in
OL,13,Ffront of the nation is challenging
OL,14,Fenough but he also feels personally
OL,15,Fresponsible for "making or breaking"
OL,16,Fhis family's Saturday nights.
